    "intro_narrative": "You are a rogue operative trapped deep within the subterranean server levels of the mega-corporation 'OmniCorp'. Their latest AI weapon is about to come online, and you are the only one who can extract its source code to shut it down. The facility is in full lockdown, and the corporate security forces are rapidly moving in. You must navigate a labyrinth of cryptographic safeguards, encrypted archives, and automated defense protocols before they breach the server room's reinforced blast doors. The clock is ticking, and the data is heavily compartmentalized across various network nodes. Can you piece together the fragmented systems, crack the ultimate override sequence, and escape with the payload before you are compromised?",
